a. Ye Shen is a young man who loves his country. He crosses paths with Lu Man Sheng, the owner of a fragrance store, due to a misunderstanding. Lu Man Sheng has an unusual calling as she is able to help men and women who are troubled by problems involving the heart. Regardless of how their love story ends, she ushers them to reach a place of peace and without regret. Just as Lu Man Sheng helps those around her, she finds that she also faces the same pitfalls when it comes to her own romance with Ye Shen.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8.3}],"value":8.3,"age":"R"},"current_season_id":3358,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}